OL,3,ABritish Steel plan lacks credibility,
OL,4,AMPs say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has no credible plan for
OL,7,Fthe future of British Steel, MPs have
OL,8,Fclaimed.
OL,10,FA report by the Public Accounts
OL,11,FCommittee (PAC) said the Department for
OL,12,FBusiness, Innovation, Science and Trade
OL,13,F(DBIST) had not set out how British
OL,14,FSteel, which runs its main plant in
OL,15,FScunthorpe and has operations in
OL,16,FTeeside, would become profitable.
OL,18,FMPs warned steel tariffs could drive
OL,19,Ffirms out of business or to move
OL,20,Fabroad.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
